# The gcc packages of the linux-bare toolchain, published by this repository (.github/workflows/debs.yml) so that a
# fresh runner never needs the ubuntu-toolchain-r/test PPA on Launchpad (a 503 there failed GIDEON's v0.1.0 install
# test on 2026-11-17: GitHub's cache is per repository, so every repository's first run downloaded from the PPA).
#
# setup/linux-bare.sh reads these pins: set, it downloads the asset from this repository's release TAG, checks it
# against SHA256 and installs the packages from it, the PPA untouched; empty, or the download or the check failing,
# it falls back to the PPA. debs.yml prints the three lines to paste here after it publishes a bundle. The environment
# variables of the same names override them (the bundle's own check in debs.yml, tests/linux-bare-debs.sh).
LINUX_BARE_DEBS_TAG=
LINUX_BARE_DEBS_ASSET=
LINUX_BARE_DEBS_SHA256=
